WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.104
Let's look at how to update your sponsored products campaign to have no end date, so customers can

00:00:06.104 --> 00:00:07.800
discover your products year round.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:14.050
In the Campaign Manager, find the campaign you want to edit and select Campaign Settings.

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:15.300
Then, find Schedule.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:20.014
You'll see the start and end date that you entered when you created your campaign.

00:00:20.014 --> 00:00:21.900
Click on the current end date.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:26.200
Above the calendar that appears, you'll see the option for no end date.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.200
Select it, then click Apply to save your changes.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:34.200
Now, customers can continue to discover your products anytime they're browsing,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.200
which can help you gain more impressions, clicks, and sales.
